hadiths[13]{hadithnumber,text}:
"428","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne apne ulema mein se aik se zyada se suna ke kehte they ke Eid-ul-Fitr mein aur na Eid-ul-Azha mein azaan aur na iqamat thi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane se aaj tak. Malik ne kaha ke yehi wo sunnat hai jis mein hamare nazdeek koi ikhtilaf nahi."
"429","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar Fitr ke din Eidgah ki taraf subah jane se pehle ghusl karte they."
"430","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Fitr ke din aur Azha ke din khutbe se pehle Namaz padhte they."
"431","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Abu Bakr aur Umar aisa karte they."
"432","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Ibn Azhar ke ghulam Abu Ubaid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Umar bin Khattab ke sath Eid mein hazir hua to unhon ne Namaz padhai phir phire aur logon ko khutba diya aur kaha ke ye do din hain jin ke rozon se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana kya hai, aik tumhare rozon se iftar ka din aur dusra wo din jis mein tum apni qurbaniyon mein se khate ho. Abu Ubaid ne kaha ke phir main Usman bin Affan ke sath Eid mein hazir hua to wo aae aur Namaz padhai phir phire aur khutba diya aur kaha ke tumhare is din mein tumhare liye do Eidein jama hui hain, phir jo Aliya walon mein se Juma ka intezar karna pasand kare wo intezar kare aur jo lautna pasand kare maine use ijazat di. Abu Ubaid ne kaha ke phir main Ali bin Abi Talib ke sath Eid mein hazir hua jab ke Usman ghere hue they, to wo aae aur Namaz padhai phir phire aur khutba diya."
"433","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke wo Fitr ke din Eidgah ki taraf subah jane se pehle khate they."
"434","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke logon ko Fitr ke din subah jane se pehle khane ka hukm diya jata tha. Malik ne kaha ke main Azha mein logon par ye nahi samajhta."
"435","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Mazni Zamra bin Saeed se, unhon ne Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utba bin Masud se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne Laithi Abu Waqid se sawal kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Azha aur Fitr mein kya padhte they, to unhon ne kaha ke wo padhte they ke Qaaf aur buzurg Quran ki qasam, aur Qayamat qareeb aa gai aur chand phat gaya."
"436","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar ke ghulam Nafi se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Abu Huraira ke sath Azha aur Fitr mein hazir hua to unhon ne pehli rakat mein qiraat se pehle saat takbeerein kahin aur dusri mein qiraat se pehle paanch takbeerein kahin. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek muamla yehi hai. Malik ne us shakhs ke bare mein kaha jo logon ko Eid ke din Namaz se farigh paye ke wo Eidgah mein aur na apne ghar mein Namaz nahi samajhte, aur agar wo Eidgah mein ya apne ghar mein Namaz padhe to main is mein harj nahi samajhta, aur pehli mein qiraat se pehle saat takbeer kahe aur dusri mein qiraat se pehle paanch."
"437","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar Fitr ke din Namaz se pehle aur na is ke baad Namaz padhte they."
"438","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Saeed bin Musayyab Fajr padhne ke baad suraj nikalne se pehle Eidgah ki taraf subah jate they."
"439","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se riwayat kya ke un ke walid Qasim Eidgah ki taraf subah jane se pehle chaar rakat Namaz padhte they."
"440","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke wo Fitr ke din Namaz se pehle masjid mein Namaz padhte they."
